WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,370 --> 00:00:04,800
Plums? I saw a lot of familiar faces, many of whom have ancestors.

2
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:11,820
Okay, look at how nervous you are, do you think I am a great man?

3
00:00:11,820 --> 00:00:17,280
How is that possible? It's still too noisy outside. We'll just...

4
00:00:17,280 --> 00:00:22,156
will starve to death

5
00:00:22,156 --> 00:00:27,032
It's better to starve to death

6
00:00:27,032 --> 00:00:40,440
I remember that great men killed people in the middle of the night

7
00:00:40,440 --> 00:00:43,871
everyone is quiet

8
00:00:43,871 --> 00:00:46,159
The radio said

9
00:00:46,159 --> 00:00:52,450
There is a prophet among us!

10
00:00:52,450 --> 00:00:55,746
But the radio also said

11
00:00:55,746 --> 00:01:00,690
Are there any great people among us?

12
00:01:01,120 --> 00:01:04,120
How do you determine whether the person who jumps out is a prophet or a great man?

13
00:01:04,120 --> 00:01:09,120
Great man? Do you really believe this nonsense? Which one of us looks like a great man to you?

14
00:01:09,120 --> 00:01:12,120
If there are no great men, how can you explain what is happening before you?

15
00:01:12,120 --> 00:01:17,460
Stop it! I know who the prophet is!

16
00:01:17,460 --> 00:01:22,160
Ah? Who is the prophet?

17
00:01:22,160 --> 00:01:26,510
That’s right, the only prophet in the room is me!

18
00:01:26,990 --> 00:01:29,180
Are you a prophet?

19
00:01:29,180 --> 00:01:32,180
Are you bragging? Are you the only one who is a prophet?

20
00:01:32,580 --> 00:01:36,780
Believe it or not, I think you are really stupid.

21
00:01:36,780 --> 00:01:39,780
Only then did he stand up and prepare to take charge of the overall situation!

22
00:01:39,780 --> 00:01:42,780
So tell me, who is the great man among us?
